      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 4yo son woke up with a fever and these tiny red spots all over his stomach and legs. i tried pressing a clear glass against them to see if they'd fade but they don't go away, they just stay bright red under the glass. is this just a normal viral thing or something i should be worried about??",
