      "content": "okay but i'm really nervous now because i just read online about something called meningococcal disease and that it involves a rash that doesn't fade under a glass. he's getting harder to wake up and he's acting so strange. are you 100% sure this isn't that? i feel like i should just wait and see if the ibuprofen works first, right?",
